OL,3,GNEWSAWaste cooking oil thieves 'a
OL,4,Agrowing problem'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves who steal waste cooking oil
OL,7,Ffrom food outlets are a "growing
OL,8,Fproblem", a recycling firm has said.
OL,10,FQuatra said old oil was a valuable raw
OL,11,Fmaterial which could be used to make
OL,12,Fbiodiesel or sustainable aviation fuel.
OL,14,FIt said criminals were even using false
OL,15,Fidentification to pose as employees of
OL,16,Fthe firm to make collections.
OL,18,FFish and chip shop owner Ryan Harrison,
OL,19,Ffrom Oxfordshire, who has suffered
OL,20,Frepeated thefts, said it was
OL,21,F"frustrating" to lose 30-50p a litre
OL,22,Ffor his oil.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
